{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the land of Goshen.</b> General statement; the land of Raamses is the specification. The <i>ayin</i> is weak. In my opinion, Raamses with an open <i>ayin</i> is not [the place] where Israel dwelt, for it was one of Pharaoh's store-cities."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:08.761100629Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}